μένῃ φαντασιωθείς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-273"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-274]: Cf. Ex. xxiv. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-274"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-275]: τερατείας .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-275"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-276]: πῶς οἴονται τὸ παραπλήσιον πλάσασθαι λέγειν αὐτὸν τοῖς ἱστορουμένοις , etc.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-276"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-277]: καταβεβηκέναι βιᾷ . Bohereau proposes the omission of βιᾷ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-277"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-278]: ἐτερατεύσατο .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-278"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-279]: Cf. 1 Kings xvii. 21, 22 . [3 Kings, Sept. and Vulg. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-279"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-280]: Cf. 2 Kings iv. 34, 35 . [4 Kings, Sept. and Vulg. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-280"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-281]: τερατευομένοις .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-281"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-282]: τερατείαν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-282"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-283]: [See cap. xxxiii., note, p. 455, supra .]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-283"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-284]: Isa. liii. 7 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-284"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-285]: εἰ δὲ τὸ “ἐπήρκεσεν ” ἀπὸ τῶν μέσων καὶ σωματικῶν λαμβάνει .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-285"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-286]: τὰ μὲν οὖν γινόμενα περὶ ψυχῆς τεθνηκότων φαντάσματα ἀπό τινος ὑποκειμένου γίνεται, τοῦ κατὰ τὴν ὑφεστηκυῖαν ἐν τῷ καλουμένῳ αὐγοειδεῖ σώματι ψυχήν . Cf. note in Benedictine ed.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-286"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-287]: ὕπαρ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-287"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-288]: ἐν σώματι ἀντιτύπῳ ἐγηγέρθαι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-288"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-289]: ψυχῆς σῶμα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-289"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-290]: Cf. Homer, Iliad , xxiii. 66, 67.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-290"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-291]: Cf. John xx. 27 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-291"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-292]: Ps. xvi. 9, 10 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-292"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-293]: John xx. 26, 27 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-293"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-294]: Luke xxiv. 15, 31 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-294"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-295]: Acts i. 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-295"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-296]: Cf. John xx. 26 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-296"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-297]: 1 Cor. xv. 3–8 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-297"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-298]: πλείονα τῇ ἐπινοίᾳ ἦν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-298"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-299]: οὕτω καὶ ταῖς ὄψεσι πάντως μὲν τῆς ψυχῆς, ἐγὼ δ᾽ ἡγοῦμαι, ὅτι καὶ τοῦ σώματος .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-299"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-300]: Matt. xxvi. 48 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-300"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-301]: Matt. xxvi. 55 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-301"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-302]: τὸν μὴ ἀπεκδυσάμενον , etc. Cf. Alford, in loco ( Col. ii. 15 ).","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-302"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-303]: διηνεκῶς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-303"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-304]: τὴν οικονομίαν τελεσαντος .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-304"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-305]: χρήσιμον δ᾽ οἶμαι πρὸς ἀπολογίαν τῶν προκειμένων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-305"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-306]: Cf. Rom. xiv. 9 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-306"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-307]: 1 Cor. xv. 52 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-307"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-308]: Cf. 1 Cor. xv. 52 with 1 Thess. iv. 16 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-308"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-309]: Cf. 1 Thess. iv. 13–15 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-309"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-310]: 1 Cor. ii. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-310"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-311]: Cf. 1 Cor. iii. 2, 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-311"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-312]: οὕτω μοι νόει καὶ τὸν υἱὸν τοῦ Θεοῦ ὦφθαι τῇ παραπλησίᾳ εἰς τὸ περὶ ἐκείνων, εἰς τὸ ὦφθαι αὐτοῖς τὸν Θεόν, κρίσει .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-312"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-313]: Cf. Gen. xix. 10, 11 . [Also Jude 7 , “strange (or other ) flesh.”]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-313"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-314]: Cf. Luke xxiv. 30, 31 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-314"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-315]: Cf. Gal. vi. 14 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-315"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-316]: Rom. vi. 10 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-316"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-317]: Phil. iii. 10 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-317"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-318]: 2 Tim. ii. 11 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-318"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-319]: Cf. Rom. vi. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-319"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-320]: Luke xxiii. 53 , οὐκ ἦν οὔπω οὐδεὶς κείμενος .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-320"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-321]: John xix. 41 , ἐν ᾧ οὐδέπω οὐδεὶς ἐτέθη .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-321"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-322]: Cf. Matt. xxvii. 60 with John xix. 41 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-322"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-323]: Cf. Luke xxiii. 53 with John xix. 41 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-323"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-324]: τοῖς ἑαυτοῦ θιασώταις .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-324"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-325]: Matt. xxviii. 1, 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-325"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-326]: Matt. xxviii. 9 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-326"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-327]: λέγω δὲ οὐ περὶ τῶν σχέσιν πρὸς ἕτερα ἐχόντων, ἀλλὰ περὶ τῶν κατὰ διαφοράν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-327"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-328]: ἐναντίον τὸν μὲν κολαζόμενον πᾶσιν ἑωρᾶσθαι, ἀναστάντα δὲ ἑνί . The Benedictine editor reads τὸν μὲν κολαζόμενον , and Bohereau proposes ἐναντίον τῷ κολαζόμενον μὲν , etc.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-328"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-329]: Cf. Luke x. 22 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-329"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-330]: John i. 18 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-330"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-331]: ὧν ἴχνη ἐν τοῖς γεγραμμένοις εὑρίσκοντες ἀφορμὰς ἔχομεν θεολογεῖν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-331"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-332]: 1 John i. 5 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-332"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-333]: John iv. 24 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-333"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-334]: The text is, τοὺς δὲ ἁμαρτάνοντας ἢ μεταγνόντας ἐλεήσων . Bohereau would read μὴ μεταγνόντας , or would render the passage as if the reading were ἢ ἁμαρτανόντας, ἢ μεταγνόντας . This suggestion has been adopted in the translation.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-334"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-335]: Matt. iii. 17 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-335"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-336]: οὐδέπω δὲ λέγω, ὅτι οὐ πάντως ἐστὶν ἀὴρ πεπληγμένος· ἢ πληγὴ ἀέρος, ἢ ὅ τι ποτὲ λέγεται ἐν τοῖς περὶ φωνῆς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-336"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-337]: Cf. Matt. xi. 28 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-337"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-338]: αὐτοὶ γὰρ ἑαυτοῖς περιπίπτετε . [See note supra , cap. xiii. p. 437. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-338"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-339]: Cf. Ex. xxxii. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-339"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-340]: The text reads ἡμῶν , for which Bohereau and the Benedictine editor propose either ὑμᾶς or ἡμᾶς , the former of which is preferred by Lommatzsch.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-340"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-341]: κατ᾽ ἀμφοτέρας τὰς ἀρχὰς τῶν πραγμάτων ἀπιστοῦντι ;","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-341"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-342]: Cf. Luke xi. 48 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-342"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-343]: Cf. Deut. xxviii. 66 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-343"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-344]: Isa. v. 8 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-344"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-345]: Isa. v. 11 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-345"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-346]: Isa. v. 18 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-346"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-347]: Isa. v. 20 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-347"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-348]: Isa. v. 22 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-348"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-349]: Cf. Isa. i. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-349"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-350]: Isa. i. 7 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-350"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-351]: Ezek. ii. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-351"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-352]: Cf. Odyss ., x. 281.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-352"}],"chars":13823,"notes":{}}
